## Gate defect shown by the source and the log sequence

VvInject::prepare() installed a failure guard before its listCount<8 early return.
The small overlay submission therefore disarmed the gate after the engine submission.
The next engine submission armed it again. This explains the 8653+8653 transitions and
why onExecuteCommandLists used the old signature path instead of via=pre-hud.

